{
"text": "[image: Do you want a Conroy for Congress Yard Sign? Signs can be picked up, during office hours, at our Spokane Campaign HQ, 1106 N. Washington St., Suite B, or the Walla Walla County Democrats office, location and hours at https://www.wallawallademocrats.com Outside of these areas or would like a sign delivered? Contact: volcoord@conroy4congress.com]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd4V7R-k_fQ/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Eastern Washington, we’ve got a busy week ahead! 🎉 From Newport to Airway Heights, Lewiston, and Liberty Lake, Carmela will be out meeting voters, canvassing with local candidates, and connecting with supporters across the region. Check out the upcoming events below, grab a friend, and come join us! 💙 We’d love to see you there! Volunteer and donate at www.conroy4congress.com]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd7eEobE46G/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Hillyard Pride, and our table was one of the busiest in the park – thanks largely to the volunteers who staffed it and the campaign dog who held down the chair. Eastern Washington is a place where people look after each other. Pride here is neighbors, kids, dogs on leashes, and a community where everyone belongs. I am proud to stand with it, in Hillyard and in Congress.]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdzGZU2CctA/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Lanterns over the water, neighbors on the lawn, and not one dollar from a corporate PAC. Tonight at midnight the fundraising quarter closes. This is the last report before ballots go in the mail, and it is the number every political reporter and every DC group will use to decide whether Eastern Washington is worth taking seriously. They already decided Trump's endorsement was worth spending on. Let's show them what neighbors chipping in looks like instead: https://secure.actblue.com/donate/cc-soc-2609]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd61Px0gJZS/"
},
{
"text": "[image: No Kings 5: National Day of Action - Staff the Table]",
"href": "https://www.mobilize.us/conroyforcongress/event/1033606/"
