},
{
"text": "[image: Spotted downtown: a Silverado with an Air Force plate, a lumber rack, and a Carmela Conroy sign strapped across the back. This campaign does not run on billionaires. It runs on veterans, tradespeople, and neighbors who put our name on their own truck and their own front lawn. Every one of these is somebody publicly announcing their decision. Want one? https://conroy4congress.com/volunteer]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd1rWohiD4M/"
},
{
"text": "[image: Thank you to the Skeims for opening their home to us. A living room full of neighbors, real questions about health care and the cost of living, and no talking points. I would take one of these over a rally any day – you cannot dodge a question in someone's kitchen. If you want to host one before ballots go out, we will bring the buttons: https://conroy4congress.com/volunteer]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdwhvhHmyxp/"
},
